  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 12 × 3 - 4 ÷ 2 + 41 = 7\n\n**Option 1) 7 and 41**\n\nTwo numbers (not digits) should be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 12 × 3 - __**4 ÷ 2**__ + 7 = 41\n\n⇒ __**12 × 3**__ - 2 + 7 = 41\n\n⇒ __36__ - 2 **__+ 7__** = 41\n\n⇒ __43** - **____**2**__ = 41\n\n**⇒ 41 = 41**\n\nOption 2) 12 and 41\n\nTwo numbers (not digits) should be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 41 × 3 - __**4 ÷ 2**__ + 12 = 7\n\n⇒ __**41 × 3**__ - 2 + 12 = 7\n\n⇒ __**123 **__- 2 __**+ 12**__ = 7\n\n⇒ __**135 - 2**__ = 7\n\n⇒ 133 = 7\n\nOption 3) 3 and 2\n\nTwo numbers (not digits) should be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 12 × 2 - __**4 ÷ 3**__ + 41 = 7\n\n⇒ __**12 × 2**__ - 1.36 + 41 = 7\n\n⇒ __24____** - 1.36**__ __**+ 41**__ = 7\n\n⇒ 63.64 = 7\n\nOption 4) 7 and 4\n\nTwo numbers (not digits) should be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 12 × 3 - __**7 ÷ 2**__ + 41 = 4\n\n⇒ __**12 × 3**__ - 3.5 + 41 = 4\n\n⇒ __36__ - 3.5 __**+ 41**__ = 4\n\n⇒ __**77 - 3.5**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 73.5 = 4\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"7 and 41\".**",
